{"id":149,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"This Pokémon is known as the Sea Incarnate. Figureheads that resemble Dragonite decorate the bows of many ships."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It’s a kindhearted Pokémon. If it spots a drowning person or Pokémon, Dragonite simply must help them."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"It is said that this Pokémon lives somewhere in the sea and that it flies. However, these are only rumors."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"You’ll often hear tales of this kindhearted Pokémon rescuing people or Pokémon that are drowning."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It flies over raging seas as if they were nothing. Observing this, a ship’s captain dubbed this Pokémon “the sea incarnate.”"},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Incur the wrath of this normally calm Pokémon at your peril, because it will smash everything to smithereens before it’s satisfied."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"This Pokémon saved a shipwrecked man, taking him to a remote island—a paradise occupied solely by Dragonite."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby"],"text":"Dragonite is capable of circling the globe in just 16 hours. It is a kindhearted Pokémon that leads lost and foundering ships in a storm to the safety of land."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is said to make its home somewhere in the sea. It guides crews of shipwrecks to shore."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"It can fly in spite of its big and bulky physique. It circles the globe in just 16 hours."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"This marine Pokémon has an impressive build that lets it freely fly over raging seas without trouble."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It is said that this Pokémon constantly flies over the immense seas and rescues drowning people."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"Only a very few people ever see this POKéMON. Its intelligence is said to match that of humans."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It can circle the globe in just 16 hours. It is a kindhearted POKéMON that leads lost and foundering ships in a storm to the safety of land."},{"games":["Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"DRAGONITE is capable of circling the globe in just sixteen hours. It is a kindhearted POKéMON that leads lost and foundering ships in a storm to the safety of land."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It is said that somewhere in the ocean lies an island where these gather. Only they live there."},{"games":["Yellow"],"text":"It is said that this POKéMON lives somewhere in the sea and that it flies. However, it is only a rumor."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"An extremely rarely seen marine POKéMON. Its intelligence is said to match that of humans."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Inner Focus","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's intense focus prevents it from flinching or being affected by Intimidate."},{"name":"Multiscale","hidden":true,"description":"Reduces the amount of damage the Pokémon takes while its HP is full."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Brown","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":147,"name":"Dratini","condition":null,"children":[{"id":148,"name":"Dragonair","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[{"id":149,"name":"Dragonite","condition":"Lv. 55","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,542],[1,7],[1,9],[1,17],[1,35],[1,43],[1,86],[1,239],[1,245],[1,355],[15,525],[20,97],[25,21],[33,401],[39,407],[41,200],[46,219],[53,240],[62,349],[80,63]],"machine":[332,97,314,403,59,776,34,784,280,523,886,434,913,337,349,406,525,89,227,203,263,126,7,83,53,374,19,411,264,416,114,257,270,542,56,63,58,8,861,196,442,113,67,118,200,182,240,156,46,157,317,201,799,184,214,883,707,444,164,241,57,129,366,36,851,87,9,86,85,352,127,311],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-290","name":"Mega Dragonite ex","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Special Il